['vietnam-banh-cuon','Bánh Cuốn (Hanoi Steamed Rice Rolls with Pork)','Vietnam','🇻🇳',45,['rice flour','tapioca starch','water','ground pork','wood ear mushroom','shallot','fish sauce'],[[80,'g'],[20,'g'],[180,'ml'],[80,'g'],[20,'g'],[25,'g'],[1,'tbsp']],'https://vietnam.travel/things-to-do/ha-noi-food-guide-best-street-food-dishes-sample/',['Whisk rice flour, tapioca starch, water, and a pinch of salt; rest the thin batter.','Cook pork, chopped wood ear, and half the shallot until the pork is safely done.','Steam or pan-cook very thin batter sheets, add filling, and roll them gently.','Top with crisped shallot and serve with diluted, sweet-sour fish sauce.']],
['vietnam-bun-rieu','Bún Riêu (Vietnamese Crab and Tomato Noodle Soup)','Vietnam','🇻🇳',50,['rice vermicelli','crab meat','tomato','tofu','pork stock','egg','shrimp paste'],[[150,'g'],[80,'g'],[120,'g'],[80,'g'],[400,'ml'],[1,'piece'],[1,'tsp']],'https://vietnam.travel/things-to-do/21-must-try-vietnamese-dishes/',['Simmer the tomato wedges in pork stock until they soften and tint the broth.','Mix crab meat with egg and shrimp paste, then lower spoonfuls into gently simmering stock.','Add tofu and cook until the crab mixture is set and the broth is fragrant.','Place cooked vermicelli in a bowl and ladle over the hot soup and toppings.']],
['vietnam-banh-can','Bánh Căn (Central Vietnamese Mini Rice Pancakes)','Vietnam','🇻🇳',35,['rice flour','water','egg','shrimp','green onion','fish sauce','cooking oil'],[[90,'g'],[120,'ml'],[1,'piece'],[60,'g'],[20,'g'],[1,'tbsp'],[1,'tsp']],'https://vietnam.travel/things-to-do/21-must-try-vietnamese-dishes/',['Whisk rice flour and water into a smooth batter and rest it for fifteen minutes.','Heat and lightly oil a mini-pancake pan, then pour batter into the wells.','Add beaten egg, shrimp, and green onion; cover and cook until the shrimp is opaque.','Lift out the crisp-edged cakes and serve immediately with seasoned fish sauce.']]
